WEBVTT

00:09:59.335 --> 00:10:03.478
(Laughter) (Applause)

00:10:03.502 --> 00:10:05.153
I like that, too.

00:10:05.177 --> 00:10:08.873
Anyway, I know Chris told us
not to do pitches up here,

00:10:08.897 --> 00:10:10.777
but since I have all of your attention:

00:10:10.801 --> 00:10:12.388
We need investors. End of pitch.

00:10:12.412 --> 00:10:14.800
It's better to ask
for forgiveness than permission.

00:10:14.824 --> 00:10:15.980
Anyway --

00:10:16.004 --> 00:10:17.464
(Laughter)

00:10:17.488 --> 00:10:22.407
(Applause)

00:10:22.431 --> 00:10:24.694
OK. Katrina.

00:10:25.884 --> 00:10:28.908
Prior to Katrina, the South Bronx
and New Orleans' Ninth Ward

00:10:28.932 --> 00:10:30.121
had a lot in common.